Read a file by path with line numbers; supports offset and line limit (default {{ .DefaultReadLimit }}, max {{ .MaxViewSizeKB }}KB returned file content section); set use_hashline to true to include CRC32 line hashes ('line:hash|content') for exact line verification during edits; supports document formats (PDF, DOCX, XLSX, RTF, PPTX, HTML, XML) via automatic text extraction; use ls for directories.
